<style>
  .vg-w-demo-intersection-observer-reveal {
    margin: var(--s-3) 0 var(--s-4);
    max-width: 52ch;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .vg-w-demo-intersection-observer-reveal-afford {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5em;
    margin: 0 0 var(--s-2);
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--accent-text);
  }
  .vg-w-demo-intersection-observer-reveal-afford > svg {
    flex-shrink: 0; display: block;
  }
  .vg-w-demo-intersection-observer-reveal .step {
    margin: var(--s-5) 0;
    min-height: 8rem;
    padding: var(--s-3) var(--s-3);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--line);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(12px);
    transition: opacity 400ms ease, transform 400ms ease;
  }
  .vg-w-demo-intersection-observer-reveal .step.active {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
  }
  .vg-w-demo-intersection-observer-reveal .step h3 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--s-1);
    font-family: var(--serif); font-size: var(--fs-md);
    color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .vg-w-demo-intersection-observer-reveal .step p {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--serif); font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.6;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .vg-w-demo-intersection-observer-reveal .step {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>

<figure class="vg-w-demo-intersection-observer-reveal">
  <p class="vg-w-demo-intersection-observer-reveal-afford"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12l7 7 7-7"/></svg><span>向下捲動，每段進入視窗中央時淡入</span></p>

  <div class="step" id="intersection-observer-reveal-step-1">
    <h3>第一步 — 建立觀察器</h3>
    <p>以 <code>new IntersectionObserver(callback, options)</code> 建立觀察器；<code>rootMargin</code> 設為 <code>-30% 0px -30% 0px</code>，只在元素進入視窗中央 40% 時觸發。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="step" id="intersection-observer-reveal-step-2">
    <h3>第二步 — 觀察目標</h3>
    <p>對每個 <code>.step</code> 呼叫 <code>io.observe(el)</code>；觀察器會持續追蹤，直到 callback 主動呼叫 <code>unobserve</code>。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="step" id="intersection-observer-reveal-step-3">
    <h3>第三步 — 加上 active class</h3>
    <p>當元素進入指定區域，callback 收到 <code>isIntersecting: true</code>，即加上 <code>.active</code> class，CSS transition 接管淡入動畫。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="step" id="intersection-observer-reveal-step-4">
    <h3>第四步 — 單次觸發</h3>
    <p>完成後立即呼叫 <code>io.unobserve(entry.target)</code>，使每個步驟只播放一次動畫，不會在捲回時重複觸發。</p>
  </div>
</figure>

<script>
(function () {
  const root = document.querySelector('.vg-w-demo-intersection-observer-reveal');
  if (!root) return;
  const steps = root.querySelectorAll('.step');
  const io = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
    entries.forEach(function (e) {
      if (e.isIntersecting) {
        e.target.classList.add('active');
        io.unobserve(e.target);
      }
    });
  }, { rootMargin: '-30% 0px -30% 0px', threshold: 0 });
  steps.forEach(function (el) { io.observe(el); });
})();
</script>
